d Internet connection"],["Storage","5 GB available space"]],"deck":1,"blurb":"When a war between ancient mages broke the planet Driftland apart, a powerful spell was all that kept its pieces together. New sources of magic have since appeared, and you are a Mage Overlord who can move floating islands and link them together, building a growing empire to restore the world to its former glory.\n\nStar Drifters' strategy simulation mixes empire building with fantasy RPG elements. You can play alone, cooperatively online, or against other players online, so it suits fans of empire-building strategy who want a flexible mix of solo and multiplayer."}}